Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:24.50,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.92,0:00:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您瞧 父亲 我们以前就谈过这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, father, we have been through all this before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.60,0:00:56.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}按我说的去做 小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do as I tell you, boy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.75,0:00:58.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你这该死的不听话的小杂种{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you damn, disobedient little bastard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.35,0:00:59.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把枪给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give me the gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.43,0:01:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是我的生活 我要按我的方式去过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's my life and I'm going to run it the way I like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.75,0:01:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给我滚上去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get up out of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.49,0:01:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《博斯科姆比溪谷迷案》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.63,0:01:25.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早上好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good morning!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.41,0:01:26.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早上好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Morning!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.87,0:01:27.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}钓到什么了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Caught anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.05,0:01:28.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈哈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ha-ha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.96,0:01:30.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还没呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.46,0:01:34.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 你到这儿来干什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Holmes, what on earth are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.98,0:01:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来找你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Looking for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.44,0:01:37.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你继续吧 亲爱的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, carry on my dear fellow,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.85,0:01:39.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别让我打扰了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}don't let me disturb you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.56,0:01:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你究竟是来干什么的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What on earth are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.10,0:01:51.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来办一个案子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A case has brought me this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.83,0:01:55.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么样的案子？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What sort of case?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.26,0:01:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}报纸上管它叫做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The newspapers are calling it the{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.56,0:01:57.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}博斯科姆溪谷之谜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Boscombe Valley mystery,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.03,0:01:59.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想你读过有关的报道了吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I expect you've read something of it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.81,0:02:00.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}未曾耳闻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not a word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.59,0:02:02.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我好多天没看报纸了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I haven't seen a paper for days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.05,0:02:06.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一位农场主 科尔麦卡锡 澳大利亚人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A farmer, Cole McCarthy, Australian by birth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.81,0:02:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}死在了他农场尽头的一个湖边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}met his death by a mirror at the bottom of his farm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.71,0:02:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们似乎已经认定 这是一起严重的案件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They seem to have established a very serious case{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.47,0:02:14.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}指控凶手就是死者的儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}against the son of the murdered man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.76,0:02:20.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那块石头下有条大鱼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's a big one just under that rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.95,0:02:26.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么说是起谋杀案了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So then it's a murder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.18,0:02:28.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 估计是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, it's projected to be so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.84,0:02:30.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然在我有机会亲自调查之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course I shall take nothing for granted{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.01,0:02:33.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是不会想当然的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}until I've had a chance to look into it personally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.85,0:02:35.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是自然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Naturally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.23,0:02:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不想毁了你的假期{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't wish to spoil your holiday{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.55,0:02:41.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我在想能不能说服你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I was wondering if I could persuade you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.33,0:02:43.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟我一起查几天案？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to join me for a couple of days?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.27,0:02:48.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.34,0:02:51.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真的吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.21,0:02:52.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的荣幸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall be delighted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.69,0:02:56.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那我们必须马上动身{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then we must move quickly,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.53,0:03:00.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当地火车35分钟之后出发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}our local train leaves in 35 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.33,0:03:48.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您的水 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your water, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.76,0:03:50.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 这些新鲜空气会要了我的命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Watson, all of this fresh air will kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.95,0:03:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.24,0:03:55.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}似乎伦敦报业对此事兴趣不浓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, the London Press don't seem much interested,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.33,0:03:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有很完整的报道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}not very full accounts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.42,0:03:58.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.88,0:04:00.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毫无用处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Useless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.28,0:04:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}报纸就看到这儿吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So much for the London Press.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.76,0:04:03.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}案子似乎再简单不过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It all seems depressingly simple,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.87,0:04:06.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到底是什么让你对它产生了兴趣？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what persuaded you to take an interest in this case?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.26,0:04:07.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.77,0:04:11.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}博斯科姆溪谷一案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Boscombe Valley mystery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.51,0:04:13.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}审理中存在严重误导{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There has been a grave miscarriage of justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.09,0:04:14.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事态紧急{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The matter is urgent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.96,0:04:16.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们需要您的帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.09,0:04:19.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如能驾临 不胜欣幸 爱丽丝特纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please come if you can, Alice Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.41,0:04:21.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}老天 谁是爱丽丝特纳？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good heavens, who is Alice Turner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.84,0:04:23.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她是特纳先生的女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She is the daughter of Mr. Turner,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.08,0:04:26.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也是澳大利亚人 这整片庄园都是她家的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}also Australian who owns this whole estate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.00,0:04:29.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 这对于特纳小姐而言 这只是一个"谜团"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, well it's a mystery,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.61,0:04:30.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而不是一起谋杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}not murder to Miss Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.72,0:04:33.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}注意这个"我们" 华生 "我们需要您的帮忙"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Note the "we" Watson, we need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.61,0:04:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果说这是心底的呼唤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If ever there's a cry from the heart that is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.00,0:04:36.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那它已经跃然纸上了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that it leaps from the paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.74,0:04:38.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你见过这位女士了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you seen this lady?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.12,0:04:39.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.29,0:04:41.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还记得一位叫夏比的警官吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you remember a certain Sergeant Summerby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.47,0:04:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夏比？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Summerby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.93,0:04:45.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 是的 那起西班牙纸币伪造案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, yes, the case of the counterfeit Spanish dollars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.78,0:04:47.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是墨西哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mexican.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.14,0:04:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个讨人喜欢的家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A pleasant fellow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.44,0:04:50.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很崇拜你的办案法方 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}much admired your methods did he not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.58,0:04:53.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许这就是他升为督察的原因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Probably his reason for promotion to Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.76,0:04:55.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他负责这起案子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is in charge of the case and it was he{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.95,0:04:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是他给我们安排了这个住处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who organized this accommodation for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.82,0:04:59.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.74,0:05:01.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你断定了我会来？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You presumed that I would come?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.61,0:05:03.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不是"断定" 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, not presumed, Watson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.18,0:05:06.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是"希望" 非常希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}hoped, very much hoped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.63,0:05:10.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, Mr. Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.11,0:05:11.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有你 医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and you, Doctor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.91,0:05:13.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很高兴又再见到你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it's a pleasure to see you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.53,0:05:16.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对你的升职谨表祝贺 督察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Congratulations on your promotion, Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.12,0:05:18.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.11,0:05:20.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这通常是个安静的地区{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a quiet district as a rule{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.30,0:05:23.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过依然是我自己的辖区{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but nonetheless my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.26,0:05:24.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我叫了一辆马车在等着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have a carriage waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.21,0:05:26.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah, oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.57,0:05:39.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个被害的麦卡锡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}McCarthy, the murdered man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.80,0:05:42.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从特纳先生那里 租了一个叫哈夫利的农场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}rented a farm called Havely from a Mr. Turner{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.93,0:05:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特纳是当地最大的农场主之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who is one of the largest London proprietors in this part of the country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.15,0:05:47.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在澳大利亚发的财{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He made his money in Australia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.60,0:05:49.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想拥有同样在殖民地的经历{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I presume that both being colonials{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.47,0:05:51.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让他们会有很多共同之处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}they had much in common.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.34,0:05:52.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想是老朋友吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Old friends, I believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.36,0:05:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特纳先生已经病了一段时间了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, Mr. Turner has been in failing health for some time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.02,0:05:57.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他有个叫爱丽丝的女儿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has a daughter called Alice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.09,0:06:00.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是他的独女 非常迷人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An only child and a most charming one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.80,0:06:05.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们想特纳小姐 和麦卡锡家的儿子是朋友吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We surmise that Miss Turner and the McCarthy boy are friends?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.39,0:06:06.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常要好的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Great friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.83,0:06:08.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是特纳小姐请我到这儿来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was Miss Turner who brings me here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.87,0:06:09.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 我知道 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh I know, Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.83,0:06:12.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}坦白说吧 您来了我很意外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and to be quite honest with you I'm surprised you came.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.75,0:06:14.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个案子其实非常清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The case is as plain as a flag staff{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.46,0:06:17.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我接触得越多 就越觉得案情很明朗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the more I get into it the plainer than it comes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.74,0:06:19.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以我提醒特纳小姐说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So I have warned Miss Turner that this time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.83,0:06:21.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这次就算是歇洛克.福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}not even Mr. Sherlock Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.54,0:06:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也不能让奇迹出现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will be able to work miracles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.42,0:06:29.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里的乡村景色真美{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a beautiful countryside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.36,0:06:32.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 的确如此 这是博斯科姆溪谷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, yes, indeed this is Boscombe Valley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.60,0:06:34.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那边的谷底就是博斯科姆湖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And over there at the bottom is Boscombe Mirror{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.90,0:06:36.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也就是凶案发生的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}where the murder took place,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.32,0:06:38.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个宁静之地居然发生了如此悲剧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a peaceful place for a tragedy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.34,0:06:39.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有目击者吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Any witnesses?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.05,0:06:42.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就等你问这个问题 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I expected that question, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.52,0:06:44.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主要的目击者是威廉克劳德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The principle witness is William Crowder,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.88,0:06:47.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是特纳先生的猎场看守之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}one of Mr. Turner's gamekeepers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.33,0:06:54.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就在我用完晚餐以后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was after I had me dinner,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.62,0:06:57.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上星期一是…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}last Monday it was, the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.41,0:06:59.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}六月三号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The third of June.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.25,0:07:01.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 噢 没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, that's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.65,0:07:04.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我现在养小雉鸡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now I fed the young pheasants,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.12,0:07:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们管它们叫小雉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}ports we call them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.04,0:07:07.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你当时正把生菜移到户外来种{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were planting out lettuces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.88,0:07:10.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, that's right,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.66,0:07:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我正在移植生菜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was setting out some lettuces,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.65,0:07:14.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是那边的那些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}those lettuces over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.74,0:07:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}突然我的小女儿佩欣丝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When my little girl, Patience,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.37,0:07:18.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一路跑过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she comes running up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.28,0:07:31.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}爸爸 爸爸 麦卡锡父子在吵架{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad, dad, the McCarthy's are fighting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.96,0:07:34.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这不是第一次了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well it won't be the first time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.32,0:07:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别担心 佩欣丝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, don't you worry about it, Patience,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.92,0:07:41.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那不关我们的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it ain't no concern of ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.11,0:07:42.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去吧 进去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go on, in you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.83,0:07:51.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个麦卡锡先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That, Mr. McCarthy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.27,0:07:54.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的脾气 你知道啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he has a temper that one, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.78,0:07:56.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是他认为有另一只枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, if he thought another gun{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.38,0:07:58.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在偷猎他瞄准的鸟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}had poached his bird out shooting,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.12,0:08:00.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就会乱开一通把鸟吓走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he'd let fly in a real fury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.87,0:08:02.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那小伙子也是这样吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was the boy the same way inclined?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.34,0:08:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请不用给我倒牛奶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No milk for me, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.86,0:08:06.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.44,0:08:08.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在我看来他不是这样的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, not that I've noticed anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.46,0:08:11.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 他看上去一直是个和气的孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, he always seemed a nice enough boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.45,0:08:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他干了这样的事情让我很意外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm surprised him doing such a thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.95,0:08:16.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过 话又说回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But, then again,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.25,0:08:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他当时被激怒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he was provoked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.44,0:08:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毫无疑问 就是这样的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No doubt, who's to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.64,0:08:24.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你来告诉这两位先生接下来发生的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You tell the gentlemen what happened next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.77,0:08:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.71,0:08:28.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你没有忘记你在聆讯作证时所说的话吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You haven't forgotten what you said in evidence at the inquest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.85,0:08:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}忘记？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forgotten?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.00,0:08:34.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只要活着一天 我就不会忘记{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shant forget that day not so long as I live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.76,0:08:37.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我把佩欣丝打发回屋里找她的母亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I just sent Patience into her mother{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.34,0:08:40.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}之后才仅仅移植了另一个苗木箱的生菜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I hadn't planted out no more than another hour box,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.40,0:08:42.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}休麦卡锡就跑了上来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when Hugh McCarthy come running up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.28,0:08:45.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}活像见了鬼似的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}looking like he'd seen a ghost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.69,0:08:47.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我父亲遇到了一起严重的意外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My father's met with a terrible accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.09,0:08:48.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请跟我来 我需要你帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please come with me, I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.72,0:08:49.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在哪？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.38,0:08:51.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在山下的湖边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Down by the Mirror.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.96,0:09:18.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他还活着吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is he alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.06,0:09:48.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你跟我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You just come along with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.50,0:09:54.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我把他带回到这儿来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I brought him back here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.03,0:09:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后派我的妻子去找警察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I sent me wife down to the track for the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.67,0:09:59.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个男孩有没有说什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did the boy say anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.24,0:10:01.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 没有 一声不吭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, no, not a word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.46,0:10:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他就坐在你坐的这个位置上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He just sat there where you are,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.93,0:10:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}又哭又呜咽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}sobbing and moaning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.11,0:10:05.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一直盯着他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I didn't take me eyes off him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.33,0:10:07.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}直到他们来抓他 事实就是这样了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}until they came for him, that's the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.49,0:10:09.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是不是彻底检查了那把枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you examine the gun at all,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.89,0:10:12.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}比如说枪托？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the butt for instance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.11,0:10:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.09,0:10:15.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 没有专门检查{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, not especially,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.59,0:10:18.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}枪上面有点泥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}there was a bit of mud on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.72,0:10:19.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他擦过枪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He wiped it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.61,0:10:23.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他擦过枪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He wiped it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.08,0:10:25.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 我可能是擦了枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well I might've done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.96,0:10:27.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是说这很自然 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean it would've been natural wouldn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.74,0:10:29.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}麦卡锡先生躺在那里 死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There was Mr. McCarthy lying there dead{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.44,0:10:30.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}脑袋被砸瘪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with his head bashed in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.40,0:10:32.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}驱赶黄蜂也不会搞成那样吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He hadn't got that way swatting wasps had he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:35.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而你认为那个小伙子杀了他的父亲？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you believe that the boy killed his father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.77,0:10:37.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 我当然是这样想的 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, of course I do, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.96,0:10:40.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是说还能是谁呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean who else could've done it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.96,0:10:43.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我能告诉你们的就这么多 先生们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can tell you this much, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.18,0:10:45.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好吧 我是个猎场看守人 我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, now, I'm a gamekeeper all right{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.93,0:10:47.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果谁手里拿着一把枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and when a man's got a gun in his hand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.36,0:10:48.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再不可思议的事情也会发生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}strange things can happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.03,0:10:50.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我见过不少人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, now I've seen men,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.63,0:10:52.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}相当遵纪守法的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}quiet law abiding gentleman,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.99,0:10:54.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可要是把枪放到他们手里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you put a gun in their hands{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.06,0:10:55.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就会变得近乎疯狂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}they turn into near maniacs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.78,0:10:57.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常感谢 克劳德先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you so much, Mr. Crowder,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.05,0:10:59.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}占用了你这么宝贵的时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for giving so much of your valuable time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.54,0:11:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 我很荣幸 先生们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, it's been a pleasure gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.08,0:11:08.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不是第一次协助司法调查了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's not the first time I've been able to help the cause of justice,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.20,0:11:09.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 绝不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}no, not by a long shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.66,0:11:11.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 去年圣烛节的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, well last year at Candlemas time,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.50,0:11:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还记得吧 督察？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you remember Inspector?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.61,0:11:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 我说错了 是两年前…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, I'm a liar, it were two years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.95,0:11:16.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 我们得走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, we must be on our way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.52,0:11:18.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是站在法律和秩序一方的 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, I'm on the side of law and order, sir,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.59,0:11:19.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}督察会告诉您的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the Inspector will tell you that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.92,0:11:22.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的确是如此 克劳德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Indeed you are, Crowder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.47,0:11:23.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.51,0:11:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.70,0:11:30.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些乡下人都一个样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're all the same these country people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.92,0:11:32.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是有人听他们说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Once they get an audience{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.40,0:11:33.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就会喋喋不休说个没完{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}they'll talk the hind leg off a donkey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.26,0:11:35.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您要是跟我走的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now if you follow me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.23,0:11:36.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会带您到案发现场去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll take you down to the scene of the crime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.62,0:11:38.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}暂时没这个必要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No need for the moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.93,0:11:41.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那倒是真的 在这种情况下确实没必要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's very true, no need in the circumstances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.81,0:11:44.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是件不幸的案子 却很明朗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a sad case, but a pretty clear one,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.33,0:11:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}气压很高{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the glass is high.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.80,0:11:49.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天气晴朗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Weather set fair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.35,0:11:54.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要去探访詹姆斯麦卡锡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall like to call on James McCarthy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.48,0:11:55.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是您想去的话我可以安排{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can arrange it if you wish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.83,0:11:56.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.67,0:11:58.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.55,0:12:00.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有一件事我得告诉您 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One more thing I should tell you, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.56,0:12:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个小伙被控谋杀时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When the boy was charged with the murder,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.27,0:12:04.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他一点也不显得惊奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he didn't appear in the least surprised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.74,0:12:07.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事实上 他说这是他应得的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In fact, he said it was no more than his desserts,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.04,0:12:09.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是他的原话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}those were his very words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.33,0:12:10.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}算是认罪了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A confession?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.62,0:12:11.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你也可以这样想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You might think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.59,0:12:13.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那他是不是也宣称了自己的清白？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did he also protest his innocence?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.61,0:12:14.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.04,0:12:17.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过罪犯总是这样说的 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But then again, they always do don't they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.30,0:12:18.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想我们最好还是回旅馆去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think we best be getting back to the hotel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.01,0:12:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还去庄园做些拜访{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have some calls to make on the estate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.65,0:12:24.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那明天见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Until tomorrow then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.47,0:12:26.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}博斯科姆 阿姆斯旅馆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Boscombe Arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.45,0:12:40.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那男孩说这是他应得的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The boy said he got no more than his desserts,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.87,0:12:43.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 这样说相当可疑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}well that's a pretty suspicious remark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.93,0:12:47.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是说 在发生了这么多事之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean, coming after such a damning series of events.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.29,0:12:49.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}相反地 在目前这恰好是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On the contrary the brightest rips I can see{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.94,0:12:51.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在云层中我能看到的最明亮的一线曙光了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the clouds at present.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.43,0:12:54.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他话中流露出的悔悟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Self-approach contrition displayed by his remark{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.32,0:12:55.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是一种健康心态的象征{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}appears to be signs of a healthy mind,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.94,0:12:57.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说明他不心虚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}rather than a guilty one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.77,0:13:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}比这微小得多的证据 都曾把许多人送上了绞架{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Many men have been hanged on far slighter evidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.07,0:13:01.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}确实如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So they have{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.94,0:13:04.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}许多人被错误地送上了绞架{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and many men have been hanged wrongfully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.39,0:13:06.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瞧 一只野鸡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, look, a pheasant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.09,0:13:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯 听这证词{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mm, witness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.01,0:13:23.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}詹姆斯麦卡锡说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's James McCarthy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.65,0:13:25.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我和我的父亲进行了一次谈话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had a conversation with my father,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.05,0:13:27.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}言辞渐渐激烈起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which led to high words,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.22,0:13:29.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}差点就要吵开了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and almost to blows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.48,0:13:32.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为他的脾气渐渐难以控制{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As his temper was becoming ungovernable,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.77,0:13:35.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就离开了他 往山上走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I left him and went up the hill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.93,0:13:39.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走出不到一百码{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hadn't gone more than a hundred yards{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.73,0:13:42.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}突然听到一声很可怕的呼喊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when I heard a hideous outcry,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.41,0:13:45.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}使我马上往回赶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which caused me to run back again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.57,0:13:47.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我发现我父亲躺在地上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I found my father{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.04,0:13:49.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快要断气了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}expiring on the ground{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.09,0:13:53.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}头部严重受伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with his head terribly injured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.75,0:13:55.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你回去的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you see anyone near your father{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.66,0:13:57.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有没有看到你父亲的周围有什么人？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when you returned?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.12,0:13:58.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 一个人也没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, no one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.72,0:14:02.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不知道他是怎么受的伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have no idea how he came by his injuries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.55,0:14:03.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他不是一个讨人喜欢的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was not a popular man,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.89,0:14:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但据我所知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but as far as I know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.08,0:14:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他没有什么健在的敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he had no active enemies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.16,0:14:09.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对这点我只知道这么多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know nothing further of the matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.93,0:14:13.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你父亲咽气之前 有没有跟你说起什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did your father say anything to you before he died?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.20,0:14:14.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他咕哝了几句话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He mumbled a few words{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.88,0:14:18.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是我能听清的就是他提到了一只老鼠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but all I could catch was some allusion to a rat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.42,0:14:21.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安静 肃静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Silence, be quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.98,0:14:26.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一只老鼠？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A rat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.21,0:14:27.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对此你有什么看法？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what did you understand by that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.92,0:14:29.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对我而言毫无意义{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It conveyed nothing to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.90,0:14:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我觉得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.04,0:14:34.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我觉得他神志不清{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}well I thought he was delirious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.56,0:14:36.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你和你父亲临终前的这次争吵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What was the point upon which you and your father{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.89,0:14:39.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是关于什么事情的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}had this final quarrel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.90,0:14:48.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不想回答这个问题 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I should prefer not to answer that question, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.83,0:14:50.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恐怕我得坚持这个要求{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm afraid that I must press it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.53,0:14:52.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我真的不可能告诉您{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It really is impossible for me to tell you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.69,0:14:54.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是我可以向您保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I can assure you that it had nothing to do{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.12,0:14:57.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它与此后的悲剧无关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with the sad tragedy that followed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.01,0:14:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是否有关要留待法庭来判断{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is for the court to decide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.83,0:15:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我必须向你指出{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I need hardly point out to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.15,0:15:02.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你拒绝回答问题的行为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that your refusal to answer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.40,0:15:03.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在未来的可能进行的诉讼中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will prejudice your case considerably{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.97,0:15:05.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将对你的案子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in any future proceedings,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.09,0:15:06.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}十分不利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which may arise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.94,0:15:08.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可以坐下了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You may sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.18,0:15:15.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陪审团的先生们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gentlemen of the jury,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.58,0:15:18.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们在这里是为了查清{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you are here to discover the cause of death{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.12,0:15:19.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}威廉麦卡锡先生的死因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of Mr. William McCarthy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.32,0:15:21.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后宣布你们的裁决{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and thereafter to deliver your verdict.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.31,0:15:23.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们已经听到这起罪案的相关事实了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have heard the facts of this crime{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.41,0:15:26.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信这些事实让案情相当明朗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I believe they make the situation very clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.57,0:15:30.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}詹姆斯麦卡锡对他父亲的死的供述{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. James McCarthy's account of his father's dying{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.23,0:15:32.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就算退一步来说也是很奇怪的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is singular to say the least.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.62,0:15:36.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他拒绝提供他与其父最后对话的细节{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His refusal to give any details of their last conversation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.01,0:15:39.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这对他极为不利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}must go very much against him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.25,0:15:42.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在我看来 做出故意谋杀的裁决{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The verdict of willful murder seems to me to fit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.74,0:15:45.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}与我们所听到的事实是相符的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the facts we have heard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.03,0:15:47.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}希望我说得够清楚了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hope I make myself clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.82,0:15:53.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么就是故意谋杀了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So willful murder it was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.40,0:15:55.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}难以置信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Monstrous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.01,0:15:57.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 这小伙子的确也是自找的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well the boy did rather ask for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.82,0:15:59.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我亲爱的华生 你难道没发现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My dear Watson, don't you see that both you and the coroner{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.70,0:16:00.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你和验尸官都没能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}have been some pains{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.71,0:16:04.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}指出对这位年轻人最有利的一点吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to single out the strongest points in the young man's favor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.15,0:16:06.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你没发现你们都认为他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't you see that you're terribly giving credit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.11,0:16:08.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想象力过于丰富或过度缺乏吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for much too much imagination or too little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.20,0:16:10.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说太缺乏 是因为他没能编造出一个吵架理由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Too little, if he could not invent a quarrel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.41,0:16:12.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来博得陪审团的同情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which would give him the sympathy of the jury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.13,0:16:15.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说太丰富 是他居然故意说出{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Too much, if he evolved from his own{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.06,0:16:16.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}死亡与一只老鼠有关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}inner consciousness anything so outr{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.71,0:16:19.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么有悖常理的说辞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as a dying of reference to a rat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.59,0:16:21.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些乡村验尸官总以为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, these country coroners do think{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.45,0:16:23.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}自己是什么万能的神明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}they're little tin pot gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.32,0:16:25.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那完全是不光彩的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's an absolute scandal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.67,0:16:28.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不不不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.52,0:16:31.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我处理这个案子必须以这个观点为基础{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall approach this case from the point of view{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.30,0:16:35.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就是这位年轻人所说的话是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of what this young man says is true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.76,0:17:09.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们来了一位访客{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have a visitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.05,0:17:13.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们年轻的委托人到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our young client has arrived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.68,0:17:27.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请进{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.78,0:17:31.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您来了我太高兴了 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm so glad you've come, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.97,0:17:33.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我叫爱丽丝特纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm Alice Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.57,0:17:35.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这位是我的朋友和同事 华生医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And this is my friend and colleague, Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.31,0:17:38.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 华生医生 久仰 - 特纳小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Dr. Watson, of course. - Miss Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.24,0:17:39.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是您用那么充满趣味的笔触{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is you who have written down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.77,0:17:41.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把福尔摩斯先生的一些案子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}some of Mr. Holmes' cases{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.30,0:17:42.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}记录了下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in such an interesting way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.97,0:17:44.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你瞧 我了解您的一切 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You see I know all about you, Mr. Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.90,0:17:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有您的过人成就{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and your wonderful success.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.04,0:17:49.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您知道我们此刻是多么需要您吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you knew how much we need you now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.72,0:17:51.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过您对已发生的事有所了解吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but do you yet know anything of what happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.84,0:17:54.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请坐 特纳小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please sit down Miss Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.01,0:17:57.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夏比督察已经告诉过我一些情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Inspector Summerby has told me something of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.37,0:17:58.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 是的 那位督察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, yes, the Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.97,0:18:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他把您的地址给了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He gave me your address.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.23,0:18:03.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是个不错的人 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's quite a kind man, isn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.67,0:18:05.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过他不明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But he doesn't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.93,0:18:08.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他又怎么能明白呢？他是位警察啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How could he, he's a policeman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.99,0:18:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 我知道这不是詹姆斯干的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Holmes, I know that James didn't do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.93,0:18:15.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know it and{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.45,0:18:17.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而我也希望您在开始调查的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want you to start your work{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.59,0:18:18.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能抱着同样的看法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}knowing it too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.96,0:18:21.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对此您永远也不要怀疑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never let yourself doubt upon that point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.76,0:18:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你认识詹姆斯麦卡锡很久了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you known James McCarthy a long time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.99,0:18:26.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 认识他一辈子了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, all my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.56,0:18:29.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们打小就认识{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have known each other since we were children,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.21,0:18:32.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他心肠很软 连一只苍蝇都不会去伤害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but he's too tender-hearted to hurt a fly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.97,0:18:34.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对于那些真正了解他的人来说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This charge is just absurd to anyone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.91,0:18:36.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这项指控实在是荒唐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who really knows him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.51,0:18:39.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那我希望我们可以还他清白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, I hope that we may clear him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.72,0:18:41.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会尽我所能的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall do all I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.46,0:18:43.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是从您已经听到的来看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But from what you've heard already,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.16,0:18:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您不觉得他是无辜的吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}do you not think he's innocent?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.97,0:18:49.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我觉得那是有可能的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think it is probable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.18,0:18:51.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道我的朋友还有所怀疑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know my friend is so convinced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.03,0:18:55.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想福尔摩斯先生的这个结论{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think that Mr. Holmes is being a little,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.59,0:18:57.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}下得有点太快了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a little quick in his conclusions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.80,0:18:59.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但您是对的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But you are right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.58,0:19:00.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 我知道您是对的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, I know that you are right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.84,0:19:04.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}詹姆斯永远不会这么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}James never did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.73,0:19:06.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对于他不愿向验尸官谈起的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This quarrel with his father,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.58,0:19:08.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他与他父亲之间的争吵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which he would not talk about to the coroner,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.84,0:19:10.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是否有所了解？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}do you know anything of it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.13,0:19:12.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信那是因为此事涉及到我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I believe it was because I was concerned in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.74,0:19:16.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哪个方面？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In what way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.21,0:19:20.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在不是遮遮掩掩的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is no time to hide anything now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.15,0:19:21.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}詹姆斯和他的父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}James and his father{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.18,0:19:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为我有过很多争执{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}had many disagreements about me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.83,0:19:25.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}麦卡锡先生很希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. McCarthy was very anxious{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.64,0:19:27.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们能够结婚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that there should be a marriage between us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.01,0:19:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是詹姆斯和我之间的爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but James and I have always loved each other{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.38,0:19:32.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一直都是兄妹般的感情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}like brother and sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.15,0:19:35.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然我们近来不常见面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course we haven't seen so much of each other lately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.20,0:19:37.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我离家到寄宿学校上学 也有好几年了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have been away at boarding school for some years{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.92,0:19:40.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而詹姆斯一直在利物浦上学{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and James has been studying in Liverpool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.57,0:19:43.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他只有22岁而且生活阅历不多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is only 22 and has seen very little of life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.83,0:19:49.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以 呃 我想 现在他还不想结婚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and well, I suppose he does not wish to do anything like that just yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.76,0:19:52.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}于是他们就有了争吵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So there were quarrels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.33,0:19:56.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而我想这次也是一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And this, I'm sure, was one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.12,0:19:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你多大了 特纳小姐？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How old are you, Miss Turner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.57,0:20:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我18了 就快19岁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am 18, quite nearly 19.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.06,0:20:06.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像你所说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As you say,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.74,0:20:09.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这不是遮遮掩掩的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}this isn't a time to hide anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.48,0:20:15.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你有没有爱上詹姆斯麦卡锡？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you in love with James McCarthy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.27,0:20:24.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 我爱他 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, I am, Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.93,0:20:29.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常爱他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}very much in love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.25,0:20:30.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再没有其他人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is no one else{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.09,0:20:34.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以后也不会有 即使{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and never will be even if,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.33,0:20:36.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那他对你的感情呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And he with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.24,0:20:38.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 我想也是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, I think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.74,0:20:41.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希望如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hope so,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.53,0:20:44.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我怎么敢肯定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but how should I know for sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.24,0:20:47.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们从未谈起过婚事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have never discussed marriage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.69,0:20:51.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的父亲赞成这样的联姻吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was your father in favor of such a union?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.38,0:20:56.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 他反对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, he was adverse to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.18,0:21:00.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除了麦卡锡先生 没人赞成这桩婚事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No one but Mr. McCarthy was in favor of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.60,0:21:05.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你对我们如此坦诚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you for being so frank with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.78,0:21:07.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是我去拜访你父亲的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I was to visit your father{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.66,0:21:09.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我能见到他吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}could I see him, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.15,0:21:10.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恐怕不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm afraid not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.58,0:21:12.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}医生不许他会客{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The doctor has forbidden any visitors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.63,0:21:15.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很抱歉 我们不知道他病得这么厉害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, I'm sorry, we did not know he was so ill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.63,0:21:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的父亲身体一直比较虚弱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My father has never been strong{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.71,0:21:19.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过这件事让他彻底地垮了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but this has broken him completely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.98,0:21:21.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 他卧床不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, he has taken to his bed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.47,0:21:23.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}威洛医生说他已经行将就木了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and Dr. Willow says that he's a wreck{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.25,0:21:25.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}精神也垮了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and his nervous system is shattered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.26,0:21:26.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我几乎没法离开他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well I can hardly leave him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.77,0:21:29.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要不我就会去火车站接您了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or I would've been at the railway station to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.48,0:21:30.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 您要知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, you see,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.83,0:21:32.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从前在澳大利亚认识我父亲的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. McCarthy was the only man alive{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.88,0:21:35.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就只剩下麦卡锡先生了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who had known dad in the old days in Australia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.84,0:21:36.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}澳大利亚？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Australia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.99,0:21:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在维多利亚州的矿上 金矿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In Victoria at the mines, the gold mines,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.78,0:21:43.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}父亲就是在那里发的财{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that's where dad made all his money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.71,0:21:50.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你帮了我的大忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have been of material assistance to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.92,0:21:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您会去探望詹姆斯？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will you be able to see James?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.76,0:21:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.40,0:21:59.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉他我知道他是无辜的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell him that I know him to be innocent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.22,0:22:00.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.09,0:22:06.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您能不能把这个给他？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Could you give him this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.81,0:22:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.99,0:22:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您要是有消息会告诉我的 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And if you have any news you will tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.90,0:22:14.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我现在得回家了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I must go home now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.53,0:22:16.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我留下家父在家睡觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I left my father asleep but if he awakes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.52,0:22:20.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过要是他醒了而我又不在那儿 他会心烦的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I'm not there he'll be upset.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.13,0:22:21.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.36,0:22:31.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再见 上帝保佑您调查顺利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Goodbye and God help you in your undertaking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.63,0:22:58.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早上好 督察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Morning Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.58,0:23:19.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以单独见他吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I see him alone, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.42,0:23:20.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以的 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As you wish, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.95,0:23:22.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是记住这个人还在羁押中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But remember this man is on remand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.55,0:23:23.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}被指控故意谋杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}accused of willful murder{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.02,0:23:24.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您都知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and as you well know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.66,0:23:26.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在这样的环境下这样的一个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}such a man under such circumstances{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.21,0:23:28.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是不可能说真话的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}isn't likely to speak the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.10,0:23:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 谢谢你的忠告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, thank you for your good advice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.33,0:23:38.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}詹姆斯麦卡锡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}James McCarthy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.14,0:23:39.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是歇洛克.福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}my name is Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.67,0:23:40.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是来帮你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm here to help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.96,0:23:42.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我怎么才知道是不是真的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How should I know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.66,0:23:44.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你和警方的督察一起来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You came with the police Inspector,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.19,0:23:45.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我看见他在外面了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I saw him out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.73,0:23:49.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是应特纳小姐的要求来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm here at the request of Miss Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.17,0:24:07.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对不起 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am sorry, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.61,0:24:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}近来我学会了不要相信任何人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lately I've learned to trust no one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.05,0:24:12.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恐怕您来迟了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm afraid you've come too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.00,0:24:14.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们已经断定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They've already made up their minds{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.64,0:24:15.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是有罪的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that I am guilty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.93,0:24:17.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, I have not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.74,0:24:18.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是死因庭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Coroner's court.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.09,0:24:20.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 是的 死因庭的陪审团{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh yes, and the Coroner's jury,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.94,0:24:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对调查的事实一无所知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}innocent to inquire into the facts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.03,0:24:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们坐在那里却没有在审案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They do not sit in judgment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.23,0:24:28.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 我怎么才能帮上忙？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, how can I help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.66,0:24:31.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要你告诉我准确的事发经过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'd like you to tell me exactly what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.41,0:24:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我们在这里坐下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's sit down over here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.00,0:24:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样可以小声细谈而不会被偷听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}where we can talk quietly and not be overheard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.97,0:24:45.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我该从哪儿说起呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where shall I start?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.29,0:24:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}随便你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You choose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.40,0:24:52.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 我在利物浦上学大约有三年了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, I've been studying in Liverpool for some three years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.46,0:24:53.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我父亲非常希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My father was most anxious{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.76,0:24:57.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我能得到学术方面的资格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I should have some academic qualifications.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.03,0:24:58.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就在那一天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was on that day,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.45,0:25:01.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}六月三号 我回到了家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}June the 3rd that I returned home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.54,0:25:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你父亲当时正在等你吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was your father expecting you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.70,0:25:05.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不 不完全是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, no, not exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.12,0:25:06.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他知道我可以放几天假{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He knew I was due for a few days holiday,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.04,0:25:08.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过不知道确切的日期{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but not the exact date.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.06,0:25:12.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们当地的客车把我 从村子带回了农场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our local carrier took me up to the farm from the village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.57,0:25:15.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}欢迎回家 很高兴见到你回来 詹姆斯少爷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Welcome home, nice to see you back, Master James.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.95,0:25:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 回来真好 乔治{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, it's nice to be back, George.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.00,0:25:19.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗨 斯坦 斯坦？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, Stan, Stan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.39,0:25:20.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我父亲在屋里吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is my father in the house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.78,0:25:23.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不 大概五分钟之前出去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, no, went off about five minutes ago,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.67,0:25:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好像有什么心事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}looked as though he had something on his mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.28,0:25:28.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好的 乔治{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, George.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.19,0:25:30.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你待会儿要用小马吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will you be wanting pony later?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.87,0:25:33.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不 我明天再骑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, no, I'll ride tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.31,0:25:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也许该带上把枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I might have a gun,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.11,0:25:35.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看能不能打上几只兔子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}see if I could pull a few rabbits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.81,0:25:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来了很多狩猎的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Plenty shooting,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.31,0:25:39.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把这地方挤满了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}place is crawling with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.43,0:25:40.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}欢迎回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.17,0:25:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你好 父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hello, father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.23,0:26:01.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}詹姆斯？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}James?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.42,0:26:03.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在这儿干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.54,0:26:06.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我回来过几天 就这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm just here for a few days that's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.95,0:26:08.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 我不想你到这下面来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, I don't want you down here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.69,0:26:09.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以赶紧上去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so get up out of it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.59,0:26:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}离得远远的 明白了吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}keep away from it, do you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.58,0:26:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好… 为什么呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.42,0:26:14.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}关你屁事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}None of your damn business!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.82,0:26:16.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}按我说的做就好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just do as you're told.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.36,0:26:19.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}詹姆斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}James.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.91,0:26:27.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瞧 既然你都来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, now you are here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.55,0:26:29.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就去特纳家一趟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}get over the Turner's place{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.33,0:26:30.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉那女孩你要娶她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and tell that girl you'll marry her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.65,0:26:31.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不干{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll do no such thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.72,0:26:33.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您瞧 父亲 我们以前就谈过这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, father, we have been through all this before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.25,0:26:34.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}按我说的去做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do as I tell you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.02,0:26:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你这该死的不听话的小杂种{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you damn, disobedient, little bastard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.26,0:26:40.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把枪给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give me the gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.60,0:26:44.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 把枪给我 - 这是我的生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Give me the gun! - It's my life and{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.68,0:26:47.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要按我的方式去过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm going to run it the way I like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.39,0:26:55.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好吧 该死的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, damn you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.77,0:26:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要把你赶出家门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll throw you out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.44,0:26:59.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要毁了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll ruin you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.32,0:27:01.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你走着瞧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'll see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.37,0:27:03.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在给我滚开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now get off out of it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.85,0:27:10.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还没走几步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had hardly gone any distance at all{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.97,0:27:14.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就听到一声可怕的尖叫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when I heard a terrible scream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.80,0:27:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我往回跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I ran back down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.98,0:27:18.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}发现我父亲侧躺着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and found my father lying on his side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.80,0:27:20.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你有没有看见别人？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you see anyone else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.26,0:27:21.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.31,0:27:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到处都没有动静吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No movement anywhere?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.49,0:27:24.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 我光顾着看我的父亲了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, my attention was entirely on my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.82,0:27:27.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他伤得很厉害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was terribly wounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.61,0:27:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不肯把你和你父亲这次争吵的内容{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would not tell the coroner{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.52,0:27:33.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉验尸官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}about this quarrel with your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.13,0:27:34.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是我的私事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was something private.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.09,0:27:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}又不关他的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was no business of his.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.31,0:27:38.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是因为和你父亲的这次冲突{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was it not because this confrontation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.95,0:27:41.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会对你不利吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with your father might seem to incriminate you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.35,0:27:46.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不 是因为关系到爱丽丝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, no, it was because it concerned Alice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.85,0:27:50.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个不关验尸官或是其他人的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was no business of the coroners or anyone else's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.36,0:27:53.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不想她的名字在法庭上 被人随意谈论{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wasn't going to have her name bandied about in the courtroom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.72,0:28:01.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道爱丽丝爱着你吧 詹姆斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You do know that Alice loves you, James{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.49,0:28:04.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且相信你是无辜的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and believes you to be innocent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.24,0:28:06.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.78,0:28:09.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在这个可怕的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The thought of her love and her faith in me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.39,0:28:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要不是想起了她对我的爱和信任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}has kept me in some sort of sanity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.18,0:28:13.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我早就疯掉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in this horrible place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.02,0:28:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然而你却不想依你父亲的心愿去娶她？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And yet you had no wish to marry her as your father so clearly wished?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.38,0:28:22.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许你不爱她？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps you did not share her love?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.21,0:28:25.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我爱她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.06,0:28:27.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我真的爱她 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do, Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.83,0:28:29.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我爱爱丽丝特纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I love Alice Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.49,0:28:31.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我… 我为她着迷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I, I adore her,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.38,0:28:36.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我拜倒在她的裙下 但是…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I worship the very ground she treads on, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.17,0:28:40.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然而？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.50,0:28:46.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不能向她求婚 因为…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I could not ask her to marry me because,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.17,0:28:49.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为我已经结婚了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}because I was married already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.56,0:28:57.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不觉得最好把事情都告诉我吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't you think you'd better tell me about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.58,0:29:04.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我刚到利物浦上学的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When I first started studying in Liverpool{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.85,0:29:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我父亲给了我相当一笔零用钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}my father gave me a very generous allowance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.95,0:29:11.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许太大方了 对我没有好处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps too generous for my own good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.36,0:29:12.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我变得很放荡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I became very wild{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.82,0:29:16.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}交上了一伙损友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and fell in with a bad set of people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.51,0:29:20.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}于是在醉酒后的疯狂状态中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And in a fit of drunken madness{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.29,0:29:22.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在婚姻注册处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I went through a form of marriage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.53,0:29:26.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和一个比我大得多的女人登记结了婚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in a register office to a woman much older than I was,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.13,0:29:30.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个酒吧女招待{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a barmaid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.61,0:29:34.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那时我几乎没怎么跟爱丽丝见面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hardly ever saw Alice at that time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.25,0:29:35.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然我也不能跟我父亲说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course I couldn't tell my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.75,0:29:37.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他肯定会把我赶出家门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He would certainly have thrown me out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.04,0:29:38.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他常这样威胁我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as he'd so often threatened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.67,0:29:41.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 我肯定他会这样做的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, I'm sure he would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.46,0:29:44.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you any idea{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.69,0:29:46.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁会这么残忍地杀害你的父亲吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who would've killed your father so brutally?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.99,0:29:49.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不管怎么样 一个也没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}None whatsoever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.60,0:29:52.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道我一日又一日地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you know I go over the scene{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.55,0:29:57.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}反复在脑海里重现那个场景{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}day after day after day in my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.22,0:30:02.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我和所有其他人一样没有头绪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But, I am as puzzled as everyone else is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.71,0:30:04.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要放弃希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't give up hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.73,0:30:07.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.48,0:30:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, oh, Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.05,0:30:09.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.88,0:30:11.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这与案件没有什么关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It hardly concerns all this business{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.75,0:30:13.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是也许我该告诉你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but perhaps I should tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.55,0:30:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这桩祸事也许也有些好处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Some good has come out of this evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.00,0:30:19.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为我被关进了这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Since I've been in here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.07,0:30:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我收到了跟我结婚的那女人捎来的消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I received a message from the woman I married{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.78,0:30:25.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她在报纸上看到我惹上了大麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who has read in the newspapers that I am in serious trouble{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.19,0:30:28.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且有可能被绞死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and likely to be hanged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.77,0:30:30.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她写信说她其实已经{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She wrote that she had a husband already{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.62,0:30:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟百慕大造船厂的一个人结了婚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the Bermuda dockyard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.18,0:30:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}老天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good heavens!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.61,0:30:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以我们之间已经没有任何法律约束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, there is no legal tie between us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.04,0:30:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是我以前知道就好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If only I had known before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.53,0:30:46.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你告诉我是对的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were right to tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.01,0:30:56.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可怜的家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Poor fellow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.89,0:31:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}被他父亲如此责备 肯定让他发狂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Must've been maddening to be upbraided by his father{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.19,0:31:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}责备他不肯做一件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for not doing something{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.97,0:31:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其实他是如此渴望去做的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he would give his very eyes to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.72,0:31:06.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是他是无辜的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If he's innocent,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.84,0:31:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是谁干的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who did it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.74,0:31:08.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.61,0:31:09.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 也许我可以帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well perhaps I can help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.04,0:31:12.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不在的时候我并非完全无所事事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've not been entirely idle in your absence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.89,0:31:16.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}审讯中 法医的证词里说到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now in the surgeon's deposition of the inquest it states{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.27,0:31:19.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}左后部第三块顶骨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that the posterior third of the left parietal bone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.75,0:31:21.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和枕骨的左半边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the left half of the occipital bone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.90,0:31:24.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都被钝器击碎了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}were shattered by blows from a blunt weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.93,0:31:28.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是这里 在后面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now that's here now behind{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.90,0:31:30.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是证据表明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but the evidence states{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.32,0:31:33.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们争吵的时候是面对面的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that they were quarreling face to face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.08,0:31:37.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个推理非常精彩 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's a very nice piece of deduction, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.14,0:31:38.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.71,0:31:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但却没有什么作用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But hardly a valid one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.52,0:31:42.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}麦卡锡在女孩跑开的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}McCarthy could've easily turned his back{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.25,0:31:44.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很有可能正好转过身去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the moment the girl had run off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.21,0:31:45.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我很高兴你开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I'm so glad that you're coming around{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.91,0:31:48.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用我和特纳小姐的角度去思考了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to my way of thinking and Miss Turner's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.45,0:31:49.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那小伙子是无辜的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The boy is innocent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.84,0:31:51.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 你是硬把这话往我嘴里塞啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, Holmes you're putting words in my mouth,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.41,0:31:52.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我并没有那样说过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I didn't say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.59,0:31:55.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过你有那样想过 一点点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But you're thinking it just a little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.40,0:32:07.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这双靴子就是主人被杀的时候穿的 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These boots were the ones the master was wearing at the time he was murdered, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.45,0:32:10.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那以后我当然是把它们都弄干净了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've cleaned them off since, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.93,0:32:14.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那双… 那双是詹姆斯少爷穿的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Those, those are a pair of Master James's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.79,0:32:17.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他上次新买的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He bought them new last Michelmass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.29,0:32:21.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 乔治 我们现在到湖边去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you, George, now let's get onto the Mirror.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.34,0:32:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是这里 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is the place, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.68,0:32:32.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您还可以看到血迹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You can still see traces of the blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.16,0:32:37.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请你们不要踩进来好吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please, would you keep clear of this area?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.69,0:32:50.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们为什么要到下面来 督察？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why did you enter the Mirror, Inspector?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.14,0:32:52.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用耙子找过东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fished them out with a rack,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.53,0:32:54.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我以为里头应该有武器之类的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}thought there might be some weapon thrown there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.14,0:32:55.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或是其他的线索{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or some other trace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.12,0:32:57.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是我能在他们之前到达这里就好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If only I'd been here before they came{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.66,0:33:00.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们就像一群水牛 把所有的痕迹都搅乱了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}like a herd of buffalo and wallowed all over it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.96,0:33:04.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}应该是猎场看守人和他那一伙人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This must be the gamekeeper and his gang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.68,0:33:07.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些足迹是小麦卡锡的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These tracks are young McCarthy's{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.78,0:33:10.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有这些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.85,0:33:13.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他走了两次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Twice he walked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.29,0:33:21.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他转了回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He turned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.08,0:33:24.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有一次他是跑来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Once he ran{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.67,0:33:27.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以鞋印更深些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so the soles of the feet are deeply marked,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.99,0:33:29.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而脚后跟的印痕却几乎看不见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the heels are hardly visible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.44,0:33:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个证实了他的说法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That would bear out his story he ran{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.03,0:33:34.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他看见他的父亲躺在地上就跑了过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when he saw his father on the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.47,0:33:37.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个我也说过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He does work at it, I'll say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.91,0:33:41.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他父亲就在这里来回踱步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The father paced up and down right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.99,0:33:46.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们在这里找到了什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What have we here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.46,0:33:48.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}脚尖印{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tiptoes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.16,0:33:53.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}脚尖印{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tiptoes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.39,0:33:57.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}方头的鞋印 很不寻常的靴子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Square toes most unusual boots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.07,0:34:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这位"方鞋头先生"从哪里来的呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where did mister square toes come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.13,0:34:15.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯可以成为一种罕见的大型警犬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He'd a made a rare bloodhound Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.60,0:34:28.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是个相当有趣的案子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It has been a case of considerable interest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.92,0:34:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.00,0:34:37.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 乔治{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you, George.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.01,0:34:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.87,0:34:42.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能不能帮我送一下这张条子？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would you deliver this note?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.38,0:34:45.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好的 先生 没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, sir, indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.19,0:34:46.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}马上去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Right away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.58,0:35:02.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这会让你感兴趣的 督察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This may interest you Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.94,0:35:08.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这就是谋杀的凶器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The murder was done with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.74,0:35:11.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我看不到任何痕迹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can see no marks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.02,0:35:13.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有痕迹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are none.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.48,0:35:14.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你又是怎么知道的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, how do you know then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.60,0:35:16.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}草长在它的底下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The grass was growing under it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.72,0:35:18.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说明它几天前还不在那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It had only been there a few days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.18,0:35:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这与伤口相吻合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It corresponds with the injuries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.24,0:35:22.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那凶手呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the murderer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.11,0:35:23.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是一个高个子 左撇子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's a tall man, left handed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.96,0:35:25.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}右腿有些瘸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}limps with the right leg,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.56,0:35:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}穿着厚底方头的狩猎靴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}wears thick-soled shooting boots with square toes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.79,0:35:32.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}抽印度雪茄 用的是雪茄烟嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}smokes Indian cigars, uses a cigar holder{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.41,0:35:35.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}口袋里还有一把用钝了的削笔刀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and carries a blunt pen knife in his pocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.26,0:35:44.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您真是了不起 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're a brilliant man, Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.35,0:35:46.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我真希望我有您这样的脑子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I wish I had your brains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.68,0:35:48.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您的理论非常好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your theories are all very well{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.04,0:35:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过我还是不能相信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I'm still not convinced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.61,0:35:52.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这次不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.18,0:35:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们要对付一个顽固的英国陪审团{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have to deal with a hardheaded British jury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.55,0:35:58.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 你已经得到机会了 督察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, you've had your chance, Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.82,0:36:01.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是一个实际的人 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm a practical man, Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.12,0:36:02.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我无法在这乡村里转悠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot undertake to go around the country{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.96,0:36:05.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}寻找一个左撇子男人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}looking for a left-handed gentleman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.19,0:36:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还是瘸腿的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with the gamey leg,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.10,0:36:09.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会成为柴郡的笑柄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}unless I become the laughing stock of Cheshire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.09,0:36:12.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们会知道的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.25,0:36:14.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你用你的方法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You work your method,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.17,0:36:16.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我用我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall work mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.81,0:36:25.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在让我们来研究一下早晨的工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, let us take this morning's work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.23,0:36:27.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我对地面的检查{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}From my examination of the ground{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.25,0:36:28.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我获得了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I gained details{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.57,0:36:30.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}关于罪犯特征的一些细节{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as to the personality of the criminal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.24,0:36:30.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}唔 哈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Uh-huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.01,0:36:31.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是你是怎么知道的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But how?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.05,0:36:33.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你了解我的方法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know my method.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.72,0:36:36.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它以对不起眼的事物的观察为基础{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's founded on the observance of trifles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.78,0:36:38.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 我知道你从他的步幅长度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, his height I know you might roughly judge{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.73,0:36:40.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能大概估算他的身高{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by the length of his stride,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.50,0:36:41.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从他的足迹判断出他的靴子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}his boots by his traces{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.75,0:36:42.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可这个人是没有名字的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but the man's nameless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.01,0:36:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他右脚的足迹 总是比左脚的清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The impression of his right foot was always left distinct than that of the left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.49,0:36:47.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么？因为他是跛足的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why? Because he limped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.58,0:36:49.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是个左撇子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's left-handed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.76,0:36:51.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为这一击来自死者的正后方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the blow was delivered from immediately behind him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.74,0:36:52.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而他是靠着左边站着的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}yet he was on the left-hand side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.96,0:36:53.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.80,0:36:56.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他肯定是个左撇子 当然了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He must've been a left-handed man, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.51,0:36:57.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在父子俩吵架的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He stood behind that tree{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.76,0:37:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他就站在那棵树后面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}during the confrontation between father and son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.11,0:37:03.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他甚至还抽了烟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He even smoked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.40,0:37:05.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}抽烟？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Smoked?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.66,0:37:06.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}雪茄烟灰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cigar ash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.97,0:37:10.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一种印度雪茄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An Indian cigar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.91,0:37:13.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你记得我的专著吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will remember my little monograph{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.14,0:37:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}关于各色烟灰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}on the subject of ashes from pipe,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.40,0:37:18.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}雪茄 香烟和烟草{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}cigar and cigarette tobacco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.12,0:37:21.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是我没记错的话 有一百种不同的类型{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One hundred different varieties if I remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.21,0:37:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一百四十种 谢谢 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One hundred and forty, thank you, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.54,0:37:26.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}发现了烟灰之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Having discovered the ash,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.26,0:37:29.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我又发现了烟头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I discovered this stump{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.42,0:37:32.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那人把它扔在了苔藓之中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which the man had thrown among the moss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.87,0:37:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在鹿特丹卷制的一种印度雪茄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An Indian cigar rolled in Rotterdam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.11,0:37:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会注意到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'll notice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.16,0:37:40.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}烟头没有被他放进过嘴里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that the end has not been in his mouth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.14,0:37:42.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以他使用的是雪茄烟嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so he used a cigar holder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.58,0:37:46.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}末端是切掉的而不是咬掉的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The tip has been cut off, not bitten,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.06,0:37:48.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但切口不是很平整{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but the cut is not a clean one,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.39,0:37:51.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以我推测他有一把钝的小刀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so I deduced a blunt penknife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.71,0:37:55.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你真了不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're amazing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.63,0:38:00.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个垂死的人所咕哝的话中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Among the words mumbled by the dying man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.53,0:38:02.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小麦卡锡能够听清的唯一字眼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The only word that young McCarthy could understand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.90,0:38:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是"老鼠"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}was the word rat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.31,0:38:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}老鼠 嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rat, hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.25,0:38:13.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常古怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Most curious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.57,0:38:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.24,0:38:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.51,0:38:34.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么读这个词？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you read?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.63,0:38:35.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一只老鼠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A rat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.57,0:38:36.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.58,0:38:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}巴勒-拉特 巴勒拉特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Balla-rat, Ballarat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.71,0:38:41.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这就是死者所说的那个词{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is the word the man uttered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.48,0:38:43.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}澳大利亚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Australia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.12,0:38:45.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来自巴勒拉特的某个人 巴勒拉特因何出名？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Someone from Ballarat, what is Ballarat known for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.27,0:38:46.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}金矿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Goldfield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.25,0:38:48.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特纳小姐说她父亲在金矿区{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Miss Turner said that her father had met McCarthy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.51,0:38:49.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}结识了麦卡锡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}on the Goldfield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.80,0:38:51.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凭着这些信息我知道方向之所在了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I see the direction, which all this points.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.68,0:38:52.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个来自巴勒拉特的澳大利亚人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An Australian from Ballarat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.96,0:38:57.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个住在这个地区的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and one who is at home in the district.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.21,0:39:01.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是我没有搞错的话 他来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unless I'm very much mistaken, he's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.39,0:39:04.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}约翰特纳先生来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. John Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.18,0:39:15.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.68,0:39:17.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.08,0:39:20.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我女儿说你们住在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My daughter told me you were lodging here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.31,0:39:21.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你收到我的便条了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you get my note?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.49,0:39:23.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, yes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.69,0:39:26.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}内容是到这里来以避免一起丑闻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}something about coming here to avoid a scandal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.23,0:39:28.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}总好过在你府上见面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Better than meeting up at the hall,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.70,0:39:31.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}人们会议论纷纷的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}people might talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.20,0:39:33.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你干嘛想见我？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why do you wish to see me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.11,0:39:46.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.96,0:39:52.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道了所有你和麦卡锡之间的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know all about you and McCarthy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.22,0:39:56.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的朋友华生会记下一些事实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My friend Watson will jot down a few facts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.11,0:39:57.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我保证除非很有必要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I promise it will not be used{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.82,0:40:01.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}否则我不会利用它们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}unless it is absolutely needed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.03,0:40:03.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请坐下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.76,0:40:17.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不了解那个死鬼麦卡锡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You didn't know the dead man McCarthy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.30,0:40:20.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是魔鬼的化身{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was a devil incarnate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.99,0:40:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是上帝保佑 你们才没有落入{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}God keep you out of the clutches{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.73,0:40:24.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个像他这样的人的魔爪之中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of a man such as he.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.40,0:40:26.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我被他玩弄于鼓掌已经很多年了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His grip has been upon me these many years{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.01,0:40:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他毁掉了我的生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and he's blasted my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.63,0:40:36.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要先告诉你 我是怎么被他控制的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll tell you first how I came to be in his power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.58,0:40:40.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是60年代 在矿区{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was in the early 60's at the diggings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.20,0:40:42.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那时我还是一个小伙子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was a young chap then,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.18,0:40:44.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}热血沸腾 莽莽撞撞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}hot blooded and reckless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.55,0:40:47.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 我没什么运气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, I had no luck with me claim,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.75,0:40:49.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}于是就上了梁山{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}took to the bush and came what you'd call{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.84,0:40:52.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}成了你们所说的路匪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a highway robber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.55,0:40:54.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们有一小伙人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There was a little gang of us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.25,0:40:56.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过着一种疯狂自由的生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who lived a wild free life of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.90,0:40:59.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不时抢劫一个车站{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sticking up a station from time to time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.58,0:41:02.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或是在路上打劫从矿区来的货车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or stopping the wagon on the road from the diggings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.74,0:41:06.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们管我叫"巴勒拉特的黑杰克"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They called me Black Jack of Ballarat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.78,0:41:09.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想那里的人至今还记得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I believe they still remember the Ballarat gang{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.70,0:41:12.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"巴勒拉特帮"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the colony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.26,0:41:35.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}货车司机就是麦卡锡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The wagon driver was McCarthy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.28,0:41:36.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而我饶了他一命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I spared him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.84,0:41:38.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}滚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get out of it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.20,0:41:39.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}继续 跑啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go on, shift!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.83,0:41:41.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别烦着我 快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do a Botany! fast!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.19,0:42:05.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们拿着金子跑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We got away with the gold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.02,0:42:09.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}麦克和我都成了有钱人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And Mac and I were wealthy men{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.00,0:42:13.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}爬到了梦想的巅峰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}beyond the dreams of Everest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.34,0:42:14.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.05,0:42:20.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.53,0:42:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们成了悬赏通缉的对象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There was a price on our heads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.63,0:42:34.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我决定到英格兰来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I decided to make for England.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.29,0:42:36.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我决心安定下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I determined to settle down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.30,0:42:40.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过一种平静而受人尊重的生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to a quiet and respectable life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.31,0:42:41.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我买下了这处庄园{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I bought this estate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.13,0:42:44.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}包括这整个村子 甚至这个旅馆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that included the whole village even this inn is mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.79,0:42:47.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我开始用我的钱做一些好事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I set myself to do a little good with my money{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.26,0:42:51.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对我所作所为做出弥补{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to make up for the way in which I'd earned it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.37,0:42:56.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我结了婚而我的妻子年纪轻轻就去世了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I married and then my darling wife died young.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.10,0:42:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她给我留下了亲爱的小爱丽丝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She left me my dear little Alice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.60,0:43:04.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可以说我是个幸福的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was a happy man you might say,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.24,0:43:08.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}直到麦卡锡控制了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}until McCarthy laid his grip upon me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.91,0:43:10.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他一路跟踪我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He followed my trail,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.99,0:43:12.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他刚到这儿来的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when he first came here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.01,0:43:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还光着脚丫 衣不遮体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he'd hardly a coat to his back or a boot to his foot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.94,0:43:19.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"我们来了 杰克" 他说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Here we are, Jack," he said,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.34,0:43:21.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"你可以收留我们"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You can have the keeping of us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.64,0:43:24.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"我和我的小男孩"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}me and my little boy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.28,0:43:26.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"要是你不愿意"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and if you don't,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.13,0:43:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"英格兰可是个法制国家"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}England is a fine law-abiding country{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.50,0:43:33.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"警察总是随便就能找到一个"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and there's always a policeman handy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.78,0:43:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就只好束手待毙 被他敲诈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was a sitting duck for blackmail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.32,0:43:38.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}根本摆脱不了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There was no shaking him off,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.20,0:43:39.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没完没了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}there was no rest,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.38,0:43:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不得安宁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}no peace,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.99,0:43:40.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不能忘却{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}no forgetfulness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.99,0:43:41.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无论我去到哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Turn there I would,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.99,0:43:45.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都能看到他那张狡猾狞笑的脸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}there was his cunning, grinning face at me elbow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.07,0:43:46.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他一定要得到他想得到的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whatever he wanted he must have{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.99,0:43:48.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而不管他要什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and whatever it was{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.04,0:43:50.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我都得无条件地给他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I gave him without question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.01,0:43:55.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}土地 金钱 房子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Land, money, houses{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.35,0:43:58.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}直到最后他又提出了一个我不能满足的要求{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}until at last he asked the thing I could not give.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.56,0:44:03.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他想要爱丽丝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He asked for Alice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.77,0:44:06.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的儿子和我的女儿一起长大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His son and my girl had grown up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.91,0:44:08.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他知道我身体不佳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He knew I was in weak health.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.89,0:44:11.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对他来说要是他儿子能接管所有财产{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It seemed a fine stroke to him that his son{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.39,0:44:14.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那可是再好不过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}should step into the whole property.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.56,0:44:17.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我坚决反对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There I was firm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.48,0:44:19.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不会让他那该死的血统{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not have his cursed stock{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.64,0:44:20.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来玷污我们家的血脉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}mixed with mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.86,0:44:23.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}倒不是我不喜欢那孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not that I had any dislike for the lad,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.47,0:44:25.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是他身上流着他父亲的血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but his father's blood was in him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.42,0:44:27.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这就够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and that was enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.03,0:44:29.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我立场坚定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I stood firm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.70,0:44:31.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}麦卡锡威胁我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}McCarthy threatened,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.51,0:44:34.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我说他用最毒辣的手段也吓不倒我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I braved him to do his worst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.16,0:44:36.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们约好在两家之间的湖边见面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We arranged to meet at the Mirror,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.86,0:44:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把事情说清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}halfway between our two houses to talk it over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.55,0:44:42.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}按我说的去做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do as you're told.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.60,0:44:43.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}詹姆斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}James.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.89,0:44:45.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我听着他的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As I listened to his talk all that was{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.31,0:44:48.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}心里所有的愤恨越来越强烈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}black and bitter seemed to come upper most{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.29,0:44:50.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他催促他儿子娶我的女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and he was urging his son to marry my daughter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.49,0:44:52.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}丝毫没有顾及她的感受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with as little regard for what she might think{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.89,0:44:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}活活把她当成了街上卖身的妓女{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as a slut from off the streets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.71,0:44:56.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们以前就谈过这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have been through all this before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.08,0:44:57.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}按我说的去做 小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do as I tell you, boy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.58,0:44:59.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你这该死的不听话的小杂种{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you damn disobedient little bastard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.57,0:45:01.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一想到我和我心爱的一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It drove me mad to think that I{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.16,0:45:02.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将落入这个人的魔爪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and all that I held dear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.66,0:45:04.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我都快疯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}should be in the power of such a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.78,0:45:06.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是我的生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's my life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.01,0:45:07.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要按我的方式去过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I'm going to run it the way I like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.93,0:45:10.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我快死了 也没什么指望了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was a dying and desperate man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.63,0:45:12.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果我能让这张邪恶的嘴巴永远闭上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I could silence that foul tongue I could still{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.93,0:45:16.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那我还能挽救我 和我的家庭在这个溪谷里的名声{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}save me and my family's reputation in this valley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.18,0:45:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给我滚开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get off out of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.84,0:46:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是我干的 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I did it, Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.24,0:46:04.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再来一次 我还会这么干{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I would do it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.13,0:46:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}虽然我罪孽深重{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Deeply though I've sinned{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.76,0:46:09.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我也过了一辈子痛苦的日子做出了补偿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've lived a life of martyrdom to atone for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.11,0:46:11.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果让我的女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If my girl should become entangled{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.92,0:46:13.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也经受我曾受过的痛苦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the same meshes which held me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.80,0:46:16.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那我是绝对不答应的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}was more than I could suffer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.86,0:46:19.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我把他打倒了 心里一点也不后悔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I struck him down with no more compunction{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.30,0:46:23.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他就是一只凶猛恶毒的野兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}than if he'd been some foul and venomous beast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.59,0:46:30.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这就是事情的经过 先生们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is the true story gentlemen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.47,0:46:36.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}千真万确{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of all that occurred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.30,0:46:45.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对你的判决不是由我来做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is not for me to judge you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.39,0:46:49.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是我希望 我们永远也不用经受这样的诱惑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I hope that we may never expose to such temptation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.58,0:46:52.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也希望不用 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I pray not, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.99,0:46:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是个快要死的人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm a dying man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.16,0:47:01.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我患糖尿病很多年了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've had the diabetes for years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.68,0:47:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的医生说 我是否能活上一个月都成问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My doctor says it's a question of whether I shall live a month{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.41,0:47:08.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而我想要死在自己家里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I'd rather die under me own roof{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.50,0:47:09.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而不是在监狱中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}than in a jail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.97,0:47:11.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不会的 不过麦卡锡必须获释{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, McCarthy must be got off, however.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.60,0:47:13.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}老天助我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}God help me but{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.43,0:47:17.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过我也不想那男孩受到伤害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wouldn't let that young man come to harm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.35,0:47:19.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我向你保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll give you my word that I'd have spoken out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.32,0:47:21.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果审判对他不利 我会说出真相的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if it went against him at the assizes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.89,0:47:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很高兴听到你这样说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm very glad to hear you say so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.86,0:47:25.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要不是为了我亲爱的女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'd have spoken now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.54,0:47:28.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我现在就会把真相公诸于众{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if it had not been for my dear girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.95,0:47:32.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样会让她心碎的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It would break her heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.29,0:47:38.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她要是听到我被捕了 她会心碎的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It'll break her heart when she hears that I'm arrested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.34,0:47:40.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不会到那个地步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It may not come to that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.01,0:47:45.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们不是警察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're not the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.52,0:47:49.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也不是政府的什么密探{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am no official agent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.83,0:47:53.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是应你女儿的要求来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm here at your daughter's request.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.83,0:47:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 爱丽丝？- 是爱丽丝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Alice? - Alice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.75,0:48:04.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你打算怎么做？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then what do you intend to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.51,0:48:07.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}考虑到你的健康 我什么也不打算做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In view of your health, nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.71,0:48:08.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你自己都意识到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are yourself aware{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.65,0:48:10.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你将去到更高的一级法庭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that you'll have to answer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.36,0:48:14.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来为你所做的事情承担后果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for your deed at a higher court than the assizes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.02,0:48:16.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果小麦卡锡被宣告有罪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If young McCarthy's condemned{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.79,0:48:18.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我将不得不公开你的供词{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall be forced to use this confession.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.02,0:48:23.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是他被判无罪 那这份供词就永远不会被人看到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If not, it will never be seen by mortal eye{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.35,0:48:27.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而不管你是否在世 你的秘密都将是安全的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and your secret whether you be alive or dead, shall be safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.79,0:48:51.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么再见吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Farewell then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.46,0:49:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在你自己要离开人世的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your own deathbeds when they come{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.15,0:49:03.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当你一想到你曾给我带来的安宁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a little bit easier for a thought of the peace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.93,0:49:07.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会死得更心安的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that you've given to mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.03,0:49:32.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 上帝啊 帮帮我们吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh God, help us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.62,0:49:45.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特纳 约翰斯图尔特 于8月16日{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Turner, John Stewart, 16th of August,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.62,0:49:47.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在柴郡的博斯科姆宅邸柴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Boscombe Hall Cheshire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.85,0:49:49.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在长期与病魔斗争后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}After a long illness,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.28,0:49:53.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}与世长辞 爱丽丝敬爱的父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}bravely born, beloved father of Alice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.45,0:49:58.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们可以在小麦卡锡的审讯中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, we're free to use that confession{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.50,0:50:00.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}随意地使用那份供词了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at young McCarthy's trial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.22,0:50:02.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 绝对不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, by no means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.42,0:50:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的承诺是除非麦卡锡被判有罪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My promise was it would not be used{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.05,0:50:06.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}否则我们将不会使用它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}unless McCarthy is condemned{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.44,0:50:08.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而我想我已经给出了足够的反驳理由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I think I've given enough objections{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.46,0:50:10.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}足以确保他无罪释放{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to the charge to insure his acquittal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.76,0:50:12.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}希望如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, I hope so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.30,0:51:31.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.46,0:51:34.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I love you too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.21,0:51:36.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嫁给我好吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will you marry me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.61,0:51:37.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.58,0:51:52.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一起精彩案件的完美结局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A happy ending to a brilliant case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.38,0:51:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我向你表示祝贺 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I congratulate you, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.11,0:51:54.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我向你表示感谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.78,0:51:55.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我必须承认{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I must admit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.53,0:51:57.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个案子中有某些地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}there are certain aspects to this case,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.08,0:52:00.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是连我都始料不及的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which even I did not anticipate.{\r}
